Q3 Vout 7 8 NPN

RC1 2 7 10k
RE1 4 5 20k
RB1 1 5 33k

RC2 3 2 10k
RE2 6 5 20k
RB2 3 6 33k

RC3 Vout 3 10k
RE3 8 5 20k
RB3 7 8 33k

C1 Vin 1 0
C2 2 3 0
C3 Vout 7 0

.model NPN NPN
.end